    "headline": "Small Craft Advisory issued October 25 at 2:19PM EDT until October 27 at 10:00AM EDT by NWS Gray ME",
    "description": "* WHAT...North winds 10 to 20 kt with gusts up to 30 kt and seas\n1 to 4 ft expected.\n\n* WHERE...Coastal Waters from Stonington, ME to Port Clyde, ME\nout 25 NM, Coastal Waters from Port Clyde, ME to Cape\nElizabeth, ME out 25 NM and Coastal Waters from Cape\nElizabeth, ME to Merrimack River, MA out 25 NM.\n\n* WHEN...From midnight Monday night to 10 AM EDT Tuesday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.",
    "instruction": "Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller\nvessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.",
